{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Be a slime!</strong></u>\u00a0<br>Bounce around the city and squeeze your way wherever you want to go! (\u2022 \u1d17 \u2022)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321330/extras/be_slime_new_rounded.gif?t=1757465565\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strand type online experience: You can collect coins when other players spend theirs, and work together to unlock new buildings ( Work in progress )\u00a0<strong>(\u2310\u25a0_\u25a0)</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Collect Gachapon!</strong></u>\u00a0<br>Collect Japanese capsule toys with satisfying Gacha-Pon sounds\u00a0<strong>(\u2661\u203f\u2661)</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321330/extras/gacha_rounded.gif?t=1757465565\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find 23 unique collectible items + more in progress\u00a0<strong>w(\u00b0\uff4f\u00b0)w</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Manage a Japanese Vending Machine corner store </strong></u> <br>Take over a creepy corner store full of vending machines and sell drinks to fellow slimes!\u00a0<strong>\uff3c($\u30ee$)/</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321330/extras/fm_rounded.gif?t=1757465565\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring music by\u00a0Keisuke Ito and DOS-88\u00a0<strong>~(\u02d8\u25bd\u02d8~)\u266a\u266a\u266a</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Unlock the mega chicken sushi chef! </u></strong>  <br>Watch the sushi go around  as your slime customers grow with happiness\u00a0<strong>(\u306